
Manual mode: what to set up (type numbers to toggle, Enter when done)
  1  [-] lea        not found: install lea: curl -fsSL https://leadeck.dev/install.sh | sh
  2  [x] locksql    databases: PostgreSQL, MySQL, MariaDB, SQLite
  3  [-] lockmq     launcher not installed: install the lockmq launcher: https://github.com/DavidGodefroid/lockmq#install
  4  [-] lockfile   Linux only (this machine runs darwin)
  5  [-] lockhttp   needs lea (its gate is lea's)
  6  [-] locklog    not available yet: no release, and lox up does not run it
